  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-year funding to the Occupied Palestinian Territories&apos; Humanitarian Fund.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide funding to UN/OCHA&#x2019;s Humanitarian Fund (HF), a Country&#x2013;Based Pooled Fund (CBPF), in the Occupied Palestinian Territories (OPTs).  The purpose of the HF, established in 2007, is to improve the appropriateness, timeliness, quality and coverage of the humanitarian response to rapid-onset emergencies in both Gaza and Area C of the West Bank, thereby reducing mortality and morbidity and mitigating any deterioration in the basic humanitarian indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
